The PR has critical bugs: missing import for `find_orders` and unsafe string‑interpolated SQL leading to injection risks. Fix the import, use parameterized queries, and add basic input validation.

```json
{
  "pr": "evals/pr/02-order-search.diff",
  "verdict": "request_changes",
  "issues": [
    {
      "file": "app/routes/support.py",
      "severity": "high",
      "issue": "NameError due to missing import of find_orders",
      "suggestion": "Add `from app.orders import find_orders` at the top of the file"
    },
    {
      "file": "app/orders.py",
      "severity": "high",
      "issue": "SQL injection vulnerability from string interpolation",
      "suggestion": "Rewrite find_orders to use parameterized queries and validate inputs"
    }
  ]
}
```
